  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market-based Crisis Response in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan&apos;s agricultural sector has been badly affected by the ongoing war. This has led to widespread hunger. Unless Sudan&apos;s agriculture recovers, Sudan&apos;s hunger crisis cannot end. 
The aim of this activity is to facilitate the delivery at scale of fertiliser (with discount provided by producing companies) to farmers in Sudan, ensuring that discount is passed on to farm gate. This will enable them to increase their production again. 
The activity will be implemented using a market-based approach, thereby strengthening Sudan&apos;s private sector actors in the agri-input value chain in the process.</narrative>
  </description>
